              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aso do inera kwanata Ejakait EDEKE ebe: Kwape ajaria, abeit aiyapositika naabu komwana, ka akaitutuket nakebili, etodolikini akouke, ",
          "type": "text",
