        },
        {
          "text": " Inera kwanata Ejakait EDEKE ebe: “Alemari eoŋ aidi naicelelei naka eres, ebwaikini; abilanari kotoma nukokuiu nuka aibutunetake, naenonok, ka aira kuiu oroŋat loeoj loimukurur. ",
