              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Eraikini oroŋat loimukurur loka Isirael: elibi ŋesi atenun, ka aira araito, eraun eres loejok: iboiete akweny nuka ipoŋesio kere kotolim loka atenueikike. ",
          "type": "text",
